OL,3,GNEWSAM1 shut northbound after
OL,4,Amulti-vehicle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA stretch of the M1 is closed in one
OL,7,Fdirection after a multi-vehicle crash
OL,8,Fin Leicestershire.
OL,10,FNational Highways said the road was
OL,11,Fclosed northbound between junction 21A
OL,12,Fat Leicester and junction 22 at
OL,13,FCoalville following the crash, shortly
OL,14,Fbefore 14:00 BST on Monday.
OL,16,FPolice and The Air Ambulance Service
OL,17,Fare both at the scene of the collision,
OL,18,Fthey said.
OL,20,FThe southbound carriage was also
OL,21,Fclosed, but reopened shortly after
OL,22,F14:30 BST.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
